  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Green Accession Policy (GAP) Lab is a strategic initiative led by the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) to support Ukraine&#x2019;s accession to the European Union in the area of Environment and Climate Change (Chapter 27 of the EU acquis). The initiative aims to strengthen Ukraine&#x2019;s capacity to plan, implement, and monitor environmental and climate reforms required for EU accession, while supporting the achievement of closing benchmarks under Chapter 27.</narrative>
  </description>
